sections.body:
You can report posts, comments, listings, events, messages and profiles, and you can block anyone from the menu on their profile, a post or a chat.

Our team reviews reports and, when it finds a violation of these terms, may remove the content and apply, depending on severity and repetition:

• A warning;
• A restriction: you keep using the app but can't post, comment or send messages for a while;
• A temporary account suspension;
• A permanent ban.

While an account is suspended or banned, its content is hidden from other users. You're notified when an action is taken and can appeal it by writing to the email at the bottom of this page.
